{"Title":"An Act relative to standard procedures in probate court","BillNumber":"H3591","DocketNumber":"HD3065","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JAG2","Name":"Judith A. Garcia","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAG2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T07:57:05.797"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JAG2","Name":"Judith A. Garcia","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAG2","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T07:57:05.7966667"},{"Id":"JCD1","Name":"James C. Arena-DeRosa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCD1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-17T15:18:56.0966667"},{"Id":"S_M1","Name":"Samantha Montaño","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/S_M1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-21T14:06:29.36"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3591/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Garcia of Chelsea, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3591) of Judith A. Garcia, James C. Arena-DeRosa and Samantha Montaño relative to standard procedures in probate court.  The Judiciary.","DocumentText":"\tSection 39M of chapter 119, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by adding the following subsection:-\r\n\t(i) Every court with jurisdiction under this section, or a court issuing similar findings of fact and rulings of law to those in subsection (b) in any other proceeding, shall follow the protocol for complaints and judgements for dependency pursuant this section as published by the chief justice of the probate and family court to ensure that there is no discrepancy in the application of this section between county court departments.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J19","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J19"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}